Notebook[{Cell["ShowStatus", "ObjectName"], Cell["ShowStatus is an option of \
RepresentationTable, RepresentationView and GroupSummary: True shows the \
status, basis and validation columns with a legend; Automatic (default) shows \
them only when a row needs attention (not computed, partial, numerical).", 
   "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option of RepresentationTable, RepresentationView and GroupSummary. \
Default: Automatic, which shows the status, basis and validation columns only \
when a row needs attention (not computed, partial, numerical). True always \
shows them, with a legend that explains every word; False never.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Whether the status, basis and validation columns are shown; a legend \
explains every word they use.", "Notes"], Cell["Views render themselves with \
every row (no paging), so a notebook output is the complete table.", 
